| **Compute Units** | 304 |
| **Stream Processors** | 19,456 |
| **Tensor Cores (MFMA)** | 304 × 4 = 1,216 |
| **FP32 Peak** | ~90 TFLOPS |
| **FP16/BF16 Peak** | ~360 TFLOPS |
| **INT8 Peak** | ~720 TOPS |
| **Memory** | 192 GB HBM3e |
